# onnxruntime-node (installed with @huggingface/transformers) downloads a CUDA build on Linux x64 at
# install time, from a GitHub release that no longer has the file, so `npm ci` fails on Linux (CI).
# BridgeDeck runs transformers in the window with WebAssembly and never uses the Node build; Macs and
# Windows PCs never download it.
onnxruntime-node-install-cuda=skip
